{"id":"655638","name":"凉拌牛肉","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/655638/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"100g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黄瓜去掉皮切成丝。","img":"images/655638/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜切成丝。","img":"images/655638/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入盐腌制。","img":"images/655638/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒜和姜切成碎。","img":"images/655638/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"牛肉切成片，放入盐，胡椒粉和姜碎码味。","img":"images/655638/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入红薯粉抓匀。","img":"images/655638/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"拌好的牛肉片放入开水中煮开。","img":"images/655638/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"牛肉片变色即可捞出。","img":"images/655638/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入小米辣和各种调料抓拌均匀。","img":"images/655638/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装盘即可。","img":"images/655638/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}